WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.683
UV light has bonded a C and

00:00:01.741 --> 00:00:02.832
a T, making a bulge.

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.620
Fixing it takes four steps.

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:05.734
Let's check them off.

00:00:06.361 --> 00:00:07.847
One: recognize the damage.

00:00:08.184 --> 00:00:10.297
Two: cut the backbone on both sides

00:00:10.344 --> 00:00:11.551
and remove those bases.

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:14.453
Three: replace them with the correct bases.

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:16.880
Four: reseal the backbone.

00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:18.006
Damage gone.

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:19.829
Like a repair crew working down a

00:00:19.864 --> 00:00:20.421
checklist.

00:00:21.048 --> 00:00:22.441
Now try the question again.
